# Never upload local secrets or bulky research material.
# Leading "/" = only the folder at the project root. Without it, "reports" also matched
# src/app/reports, so the Reports page was left out of every Vercel build.
.env
.env*.local
/research_notes
/reports
/CLOUDCAMP_BD_CONTEXT.md
/.agents
/tests
# The demo video project has its own packages and is never part of the website.
/video
